{"id":"1db27c06cce0d3e2","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-immersman-szelepcsényi.md","title":"thm-immersman-szelepcsényi (Immerman-Szelepcsényi Theorem)","display":"thm-immersman-szelepcsényi (Immerman-Szelepcsényi Theorem)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-nl]]","[[28-df-nspace]]","[[28-df-space-constructible]]","[[28-df-configuration-graph]]"],"display":"thm-immersman-szelepcsényi (Immerman-Szelepcsényi Theorem)","label":"28-thm-immersman-szelepcsényi","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-immersman-szelepcsényi","Immerman-Szelepcsényi Theorem","NL equals coNL"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba1abccdb0412836\" href=\"?note=ba1abccdb0412836\" title=\"28-df-nl\">28-df-nl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"54da139362531e67\" href=\"?note=54da139362531e67\" title=\"28-df-nspace\">28-df-nspace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"af1247ecca733ff0\" href=\"?note=af1247ecca733ff0\" title=\"28-df-space-constructible\">28-df-space-constructible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1b4d0bd43db4c9c9\" href=\"?note=1b4d0bd43db4c9c9\" title=\"28-df-configuration-graph\">28-df-configuration-graph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-immersman-szelepcsényi (Immerman-Szelepcsényi Theorem)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-immersman-szelepcsényi"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-immersman-szelepcsényi</span><span>Immerman-Szelepcsényi Theorem</span><span>NL equals coNL</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 为空间可构造函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\">\\(s(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{co}\">\\(\\operatorname{co}\\)</span> 为下式引入的补类算子。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NSPACE}\">\\(\\mathrm{NSPACE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"54da139362531e67\" href=\"?note=54da139362531e67\" title=\"28-df-nspace\">28-df-nspace</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{co}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathcal C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{co}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathcal C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)=\\operatorname{co}(\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)),\\qquad\n\\mathbf{NL}=\\operatorname{co}(\\mathbf{NL}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)=\\operatorname{co}(\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)),\\qquad\n\\mathbf{NL}=\\operatorname{co}(\\mathbf{NL}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>归纳计数先知道从起点在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 步内可达的顶点数。按顶点升序猜测并以路径证据验证完整可达列表，精确计数保证没有遗漏；据此可验证一个候选顶点在下一层不可达，再逐顶点累积得到下一层的精确数。重复到顶点数层后即可验证目标不可达。仅需保存顶点编号、路径/层数计数器和已核对数，使用对数空间；把顶点换成空间受限机器配置得到一般界。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理4.20、推论4.21及证明；印刷91–92页；PDF117–118页。NL归纳计数证明已读，一般界由配置图推论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-nl","status":"resolved","id":"ba1abccdb0412836","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nspace","status":"resolved","id":"54da139362531e67","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-space-constructible","status":"resolved","id":"af1247ecca733ff0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-space-constructible]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-graph","status":"resolved","id":"1b4d0bd43db4c9c9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nspace","status":"resolved","id":"54da139362531e67","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NSPACE}$ 见 [[28-df-nspace]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"s(n)\\ge\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{co}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{co}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\in\\mathcal C\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)=\\operatorname{co}(\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)),\\qquad\n\\mathbf{NL}=\\operatorname{co}(\\mathbf{NL}).","display":true},{"tex":"i","display":false}],"bytes":1608,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"层次结论：[[28-thm-time-hierarchy]]、[[28-thm-space-hierarchy]]、[[28-thm-p-neq-exp]]、[[28-thm-savitch]]、[[28-thm-npspace-equals-pspace]]、[[28-thm-immersman-szelepcsényi]]。"}],"outgoing":["ba1abccdb0412836","54da139362531e67","af1247ecca733ff0","1b4d0bd43db4c9c9"]}